  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "This offers 2 things:\n1. users making cross platform content can test worlds in both platforms.\n2. Users with lower end pcs may be able to try this game.\nI have run into many worlds where the shaders didn’t even work for quest users even though the world was design to work for quest and pc. The wrong shaders just make everything black and pink.",
